# X Training: the half-marathon plan (PLANS.md section 6).
#
# Written for level 2 and four runs a week. Notation: README.md. After
# editing, run gen_plans.py and look at the golden files' diff.

plan     half
id       2
name     Half marathon
race     21097.5
minweeks 8
long     1 60 105
long     2 70 115
long     3 80 130
# The peak long run reaches at least this far, by level (PLANS.md 4.1, C9).
floor    16000 18000 20000

trialweek cutback | E+S 35 | E 35      | E 30              | *TT5

#    phase      first quality      easy        second quality          long
week base     | E+S 40           | E 35      | *CRUISE 3x6             | L 70
week base     | HILLS 8x45s      | E+S 40    | *CRUISE 4x6             | L 75
week base     | INT 5x3          | E+S 40    | *TEMPO 20               | L 85
week cutback  | E+S 35           | E 35      | E 30                    | *TT5
week build    | INT 4x4          | E+S 45    | *CRUISE 3x10            | L 95
# Weeks 6 and 10 have a hard long run, so one other quality session (C8).
week build    | *CRUISE 2x15     | E 45      | E+S 40                  | L 100 HM 20
week build    | INT 5x3          | E+S 45    | *RPHM 3x10 jog 2:00     | L 105
# Week 8: the 10K tune-up, four weeks before the race.
week cutback  | E+S 35           | E 40      | E 30                    | *TT10
week specific | CRUISE 3x10      | E+S 45    | *RPHM 2x20 jog 3:00     | L 115
week specific | *TEMPO 20        | E 45      | E+S 40                  | L 100 HM 30
week taper    | *CRUISE 3x8      | E+S 40    | RPHM 2x10 jog 2:00      | L 75
week race     | *RPHM 3x8 jog 2:00 | E+S 30  | SHAKE                   | RACE
